    "h100_performance_verified": false,
    "next_step": "Qualify the existing upstream candidate with descriptor-aware controls and observed algorithm/launch identity rather than implement a duplicate cache. Its nonnegative integer ordinal tactics are replaced by descriptors, so the harness must be adapted deliberately.",
